      equipment: '52 cards. Ranks: 2-10 (Value), A/J/Q/K (1 point each).',
      dealing: 'All cards are dealt out equally to the players.',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. Players take turns playing one card face-up to the table.\n2. The total sum of point values is announced.\n3. **Hitting 29**: If your card makes the total exactly 29, you win all cards on the table and keep them in your score pile.\n4. **Passing**: If you only have cards that would push the total OVER 29, you must pass your turn.\n5. **Reset**: After a sweep (hitting 29), the next player starts a new pile from zero.',
